{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Study</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124210/extras/GIF_01.gif?t=1744884357\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start by mastering <strong>Hiragana</strong> and <strong>Katakana</strong>. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kanji Legends</strong> combines visual memory techniques, quizzes, and interactive challenges to help you remember <strong>Kanji</strong> effortlessly. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each <strong>character</strong> is cataloged into tiers and lists and can be studied individually. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kanji Legends</strong> offers a list of over 2000 <strong>J\u014dy\u014d Kanji.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Practice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124210/extras/GIF_02.gif?t=1744884357\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create <strong>custom challenges</strong> with your own selection of characters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Train for the <strong>challenging trials</strong>, with no timers and rules! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124210/extras/GIF_03.gif?t=1744884357\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on various <strong>challenges</strong> with both Kana and Kanji characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your knowledge with <strong>timed quizzes</strong> and  <strong>memory games</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0